{"_meta":{"ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://comos/view-panel-v2.html","visibility":["model","app"]}},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Show One View of a Tenant"},"description":"Show one view of a tenant, drawn by the host as the ComOS view panel: you pick the view, ComOS fills it from its typed reads. Views: product_grid (a store's products as cards with pictures; optional category, in_stock_only), product_detail (one product; needs product_id), slot_picker (a booking page's open times per provider, by day; optional provider_id, from, to), provider_card (one provider and next open times; needs provider_id), booking_card (one booking; needs booking_id; owner, bookings:read), order_status (one order; needs order_id; owner, orders:read), receipt (an order's lines and totals; needs order_id; owner, orders:read). Always pass tenant_id (\"earth\" is a store, \"ron\" a booking page). The panel never calls a tool, places an order or holds a time: Buy opens the pay page on ComOS, Book opens the request door on ComOS. Typed refusals, isError: missing_argument, not_a_storefront, not_a_booking_page, not_found, scope_required. Public, read-only, free. CO 607-004. Returns: { view, tenant_id, store_name, read_at, origin, ...payload } \u2014 also as structuredContent; the payload per view: products[] (product_grid), product (product_detail), providers[] + window + timezone (slot_picker), provider + next_slots[] + timezone (provider_card), booking (booking_card), order (order_status), order + lines[] + totals (receipt). Refusals are isError: missing_argument, invalid_argument, not_a_storefront, storefront_disabled, not_a_booking_page, booking_page_disabled, calendar_unavailable, not_found, scope_required, or the inner tool's own refusal \u2014 each carrying `view`. Example: call federation_view with arguments {\"view\":\"<view>\",\"tenant_id\":\"<tenant_id>\"}.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"booking_id":{"description":"booking_card: the booking (owner, bookings:read).","maxLength":4000,"type":"string"},"category":{"description":"product_grid: keep only this category.","maxLength":4000,"type":"string"},"from":{"description":"slot_picker: ISO-8601 start of the window to show; default the booking page's own window.","maxLength":64,"type":"string"},"in_stock_only":{"description":"product_grid: keep only products in stock.","type":"boolean"},"order_id":{"description":"order_status / receipt: the order (owner, orders:read).","maxLength":4000,"type":"string"},"product_id":{"description":"product_detail: the product.","maxLength":4000,"type":"string"},"provider_id":{"description":"provider_card: the provider (required). slot_picker: one provider instead of all.","maxLength":128,"type":"string"},"style":{"description":"Optional CSS for this showing, over the tenant's own stylesheet, written against the role classes (.c-price, .c-product, \u2026). Price, stock, totals and the Buy/Book controls always stay visible. Takes effect where this view is drawn by the ComOS panel renderer.","maxLength":4000,"type":"string"},"tenant_id":{"description":"The tenant to show, e.g. \"earth\" (a store) or \"ron\" (a booking page).","maxLength":64,"type":"string"},"to":{"description":"slot_picker: ISO-8601 end of the window to show.","maxLength":64,"type":"string"},"view":{"description":"Which view to show. The host picks: product_grid, product_detail, slot_picker, provider_card, booking_card, order_status, receipt.","enum":["product_grid","product_detail","slot_picker","provider_card","booking_card","order_status","receipt"],"type":"string"}},"required":["view","tenant_id"],"type":"object"},"name":"federation_view","outputSchema":{"oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"origin":{"type":"string"},"products":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"available":{"type":"number"},"category":{"type":["